{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2549650/extras/6448771b5a3c40ce394d509d4d10f22e.poster.avif?t=1758779838\" width=620 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2549650/extras/6448771b5a3c40ce394d509d4d10f22e.webm?t=1758779838\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2549650/extras/6448771b5a3c40ce394d509d4d10f22e.mp4?t=1758779838\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A mix of roguelike shooter and survival on an unknown planet, featuring persistent progress and a cozy hub. Attempt to unravel the mysteries of what has happened by exploring stations, dungeons, canyons, swamps, and permafrost, while battling alien creatures.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Adrenaline shooter.</strong> Each enemy is a mortal danger. Caution, reaction and aim are as important as a saved ammo and an extra explosion that raises the alarm in the den of creatures.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>At night it's more dangerous.</strong> Survival with elements of horror. Stock up on oxygen, flashlight batteries and ammo in advance to have a chance of surviving another night.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Wide range of weapons and equipment.</strong> Pistols, assault rifles, shotguns, machine guns, grenade launchers, katanas, night vision, energy shields, sound absorption, weapon upgrades and more.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Combos and progression</strong>. Recipes for unique weapons. Enhancements that transform your character. Shops and secret rooms throughout the levels. Weapon upgrades in the hub.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Solo or co-op up to 4 players.</strong> Play shoulder to shoulder, protect your teammates' rear and share resources.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2549650/extras/7cd13f3f2bb4223befedee11c246c964.avif?t=1758779838\" width=620 height=200 /></span></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"They said there was one survivor here","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2549650/69cec1a64a7e94b581f6b8c515a78ce39be2f026.jpg"},{"name":"I like to change","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2549650/90814adf033db7d41d56587c9d64667c468f37de.jpg"},{"name":"I don't even remember what I used to be","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2549650/2383977818b1d32c7ae25eee8d138f74b2bfef05.jpg"},{"name":"Unbelievable. I got out!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2549650/d190d5023389a82730b21c6c7b80dac4536bcd8f.jpg"},{"name":"Here's the answer. What's the question?","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2549650/4ab8d219c911d2bcdab7d3e53a8be12976bf2997.jpg"},{"name":"The killing machine","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2549650/5aaddc31fe2fe764bb2491c139303c44d0884bf3.jpg"},{"name":"Warm and dry","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2549650/c51d0ed9a556fa999e8080df88feed82fbc12f01.jpg"},{"name":"Adaptation was successful","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2549650/c15d319f5c95a5e0e8c0c0f676583ced5b9d6f22.jpg"},{"name":"This is my new home now","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2549650/c2a2cca12096cbb28e9485b094a392419dac365d.jpg"},{"name":"Native","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.co