hops and secret rooms throughout the levels. Weapon upgrades in the hub.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Solo or co-op up to 4 players.</strong> Play shoulder to shoulder, protect your teammates' rear and share resources.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2549650/extras/7cd13f3f2bb4223befedee11c246c964.avif?t=1758779838\" width=620 height=200 /></span></p>","developers":["Juvty Worlds"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2549650/3422fba16a7b66d3dfcb169db608891fe77aa736/header_alt_assets_0.jpg?t=1758779838","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2549650/1015636770/28dbfe3920f57353a55b9dd465dd2121506e7681/1752751630/dash_av1.mpd?t=1754897165","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2549650/1015636770/28dbfe3920f57353a55b9dd465dd2121506e7681/1752751630/dash_h264.mpd?t=1754897165","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2549650/1015636770/28dbfe3920f57353a55b9dd465dd2121506e7681/1752751630/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1754897165","id":257170230,"mp4":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257170230/movie480.mp4?t=1754897165","max":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257170230/movie_max.mp4?t=1754897165"},"name":"Release Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/25717